<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - June 20.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - June 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1440 gmt, in Sterling a tonne.</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Oct/Dec 90.00/89.50.</p>
<p>Southampton Jun 82.00 Jul 82.50 asa 83.50 Sep 85.50.</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jul 83.50/83.00 Jan/Jun 94.00.</p>
<p>Suffolk Jan/Jun 94.50/94.00.</p>
<p>Cambridge Jan/Jun 93.50.</p>
<p>Nottinghamshire/Lincolnshire Oct/Dec 88.00 Jan/Mar 91.00.</p>
<p>Hampshire Jun 82.50/82.00 Jul 83.50/83.00.</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Jul 81.00.</p>
<p>Herefordshire Jun 81.00.</p>
<p>Feed barley Southampton asa 80.50.</p>
<p>There was no fresh milling wheat trade reported.</p>
</text>
